!CHECK 232071.40 | 231545.53 80 007000.20 D0 | line 2 ST(BU,7),LCOUNT
!CHECK 232072.40 | 231623.21 05 | line 3 LJOE V+I,LXSC,LSYMC-1.
!CHECK 232073.00 | 232004.50 00 | line 4 B,LFOUND
